stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> EvidenceAdmission: Submit correction
    EvidenceAdmission --> Refused: Missing confirmation or source
    EvidenceAdmission --> ReplayCheck: Confirmed sourced evidence
    ReplayCheck --> Receipt: Exact replay
    ReplayCheck --> Refused: Key reused for different action
    ReplayCheck --> VersionAndStoredEvidence: New action
    VersionAndStoredEvidence --> Refused: Stale version or unrelated identifier or city
    VersionAndStoredEvidence --> Correction: Current version and independent stored identifier
    Correction --> Refused: Shared organization safety check fails
    Correction --> Receipt: Record correction and evidence
    Receipt --> [*]: Return result
    Refused --> [*]: Return refusal without correction
    %% never Refused corrections change identity or emit correction events.
    %% never Exact replay repeats the correction.
